look `pbot use` PASS, farmland moisture 0 both times, water source above after the item use

## SQ-FCB-09 | survival break of cooking pot, copper pot, kettle keeps the contents in the item; leftover bottle drops loose (break half)
> setblock 1060 -60 1050 farmersdelight:cooking_pot{Inventory:{Items:[{Slot:0b,id:"minecraft:carrot",Count:1b},{Slot:6b,id:"farmersdelight:vegetable_soup",Count:2b},{Slot:7b,id:"minecraft:bowl",Count:4b}]}}
> zact break 1060 -60 1050 minecraft:iron_pickaxe keep
waitlog \[zact\] done 20
> execute positioned 1060.5 -60 1050.5 run data get entity @e[type=minecraft:item,nbt={Item:{id:"farmersdelight:cooking_pot"}},limit=1,sort=nearest,distance=..3] Item
> setblock 1070 -60 1050 miners_delight:copper_pot{Inventory:{Items:[{Slot:0b,id:"minecraft:bone",Count:1b},{Slot:1b,id:"minecraft:glow_lichen",Count:1b},{Slot:7b,id:"minecraft:glass_bottle",Count:1b}]}}
> zact break 1070 -60 1050 minecraft:iron_pickaxe keep
waitlog \[zact\] done 20
> execute positioned 1070.5 -60 1050.5 run data get entity @e[type=minecraft:item,nbt={Item:{id:"miners_delight:copper_pot"}},limit=1,sort=nearest,distance=..3] Item
> setblock 1080 -60 1050 farmersrespite:kettle{Inventory:{Items:[{Slot:0b,id:"farmersrespite:green_tea_leaves",Count:2b}]}}
> zact break 1080 -60 1050 minecraft:iron_pickaxe keep
waitlog \[zact\] done 20
> execute positioned 1080.5 -60 1050.5 run data get entity @e[type=minecraft:item,nbt={Item:{id:"farmersrespite:kettle"}},limit=1,sort=nearest,distance=..3] Item
> kill @e[type=minecraft:item,x=1070,y=-60,z=1050,distance=..15]
expect break 1060 -60 1050 .*drops farmersdelight:cooking_pot x1$
expect break 1070 -60 1050 .*drops .*miners_delight:copper_pot x1
reject break 1070 -60 1050 .*minecraft:(bone|glow_lichen)
expect has the following entity data: .*BlockEntityTag.*minecraft:carrot
expect has the following entity data: .*BlockEntityTag.*minecraft:glow_lichen
expect has the following entity data: .*BlockEntityTag.*farmersrespite:green_tea_leaves
look cooking pot item keeps slots 0, 6, 7 (carrot, soup, bowls); copper pot item keeps bone and lichen, the glass bottle (slot 7) drops loose beside it; kettle item keeps the leaves. Place-back, sneak pickup, creative break and the remainder-buffer bottle stay for a client run

